{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"よう(¨)ノ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"お待たせ！\n早速、セトリです！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"overture\n制服のマネキン\n人はなぜ走るのか？\n世界で一番孤独なLover\n狼に口笛を\nガールズルール\n-MC-\n失いたくないから\n春のメロディー\nでこぴん\n水玉模様\n白い雲にのって\n音が出ないギター\n-ファッションショー-\n人間という楽器\n-寸劇-\nガールズルール<下駄っぷ>\n-MC(クイズ)-\n走れ！Bicycle\n-MC-\nシャキイズム\nハウス！\n涙がまだ悲しみだった頃\nぐるぐるカーテン"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"[アンコール]\n君の名は希望\nおいでシャンプー\n-MC-\n乃木坂の詩"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寸劇は\nみさみさ、まいやん、あみ、みなみ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"クイズのコーナーは\n今までご当地クイズだったのに\n今回は乃木坂クイズだったよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"罰ゲームは\n生駒ちゃん、あみ、ひなちま、まいまい"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ギリギリ最後の二組で勝ち抜けました"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/24/3026282/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田の髪型は\n片方に小さいお団子"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"これも初めてやった髪型"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡昼の万歩計の集計結果"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"中田は7位でした！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"１つ順位上がった！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ここから福岡レポ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昨日は夜に水炊きを食べに行ったよ！\nおいしかった"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/24/3026282/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ホテルの部屋はひなちま！\nひなちまとは初めてだね(・∀・)"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"福岡に来たのは\nHKT48劇場の公演を\n私用で見に行ったときぶりだな(´,,・ω・,,`)←"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"たくさんの方々が来てくださって\n嬉しかったです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ありがとうございました＼^^／"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/kana.nakada/img/blog/kana.nakada/img/2013/08/24/3026282/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"若月、中田、まりちゃ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"昼と夜の公演の合間"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"何回か来てる方々は\nわかるかもしれないけど\n同じ曲でも何種類かの演出があったりするんです"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ただでさえ毎公演セトリが違うのに。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも\nこのあとの公演も頑張ります"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かな￣(=∵=)￣"}],"source":"archive"}